{"id":"n67308-2-8","stage":2,"title":"얼룩 · 斑渍","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n67308-2-8-1","ko":"너 옷에 주스 흘렸어.","zh":"你的衣服上洒了果汁哦。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}},{"text":"옷에","meaning":"衣服，衣裳，服装","explanation":"옷：衣服，衣裳，服装；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"옷","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30159","senseId":"1","lemma":"옷","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"옷에","audio":"/audio/24872475f0018bd74d97.mp3"}},{"text":"주스","meaning":"汁，果汁","explanation":"주스：汁，果汁","readings":[{"term":"주스","audio":"/audio/63db64644799c8112bf0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26899","senseId":"1","lemma":"주스","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주스","audio":"/audio/63db64644799c8112bf0.mp3"}},{"text":"흘렸어.","meaning":"流出来，淌出来，撒出来","explanation":"흘리다：流出来，淌出来，撒出来；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"흘리다","audio":"/audio/a98bf9ca76ba39279166.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91709","senseId":"1","lemma":"흘리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"흘렸어","audio":"/audio/29f7d09e746eae689298.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"4bddf9b9203384c7","term":"옷","zh":"衣服，衣裳，服装","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3","entryId":"30159","definition":"为遮掩身体、防晒抗寒以及追求美观而穿的遮挡物。","pronunciation":["옫"]},{"id":"63db64644799c811","term":"주스","zh":"汁，果汁","audio":"/audio/63db64644799c8112bf0.mp3","entryId":"26899","definition":"压榨水果或蔬菜而成的汁液；或指用它制成的饮料。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"a98bf9ca76ba3927","term":"흘리다","zh":"流出来，淌出来，撒出来","audio":"/audio/a98bf9ca76ba39279166.mp3","entryId":"91709","definition":"使水或小粒的东西散落或掉落到外面。","pronunciation":["흘리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/6c7ed000510fc63ca98c.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n67308-2-8-2","ko":"큰일이다. 얼른 빨지 않으면 얼룩이 남겠어.","zh":"糟了，不赶紧洗的话会留下污渍的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"큰일이다.","meaning":"大事","explanation":"큰일：大事；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"큰일","audio":"/audio/dbfb08997ec518d3dc88.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72174","senseId":"2","lemma":"큰일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"큰일이다","audio":"/audio/9a2e36d4b4349db4a0f6.mp3"}},{"text":"얼른","meaning":"快地","explanation":"얼른：快地","readings":[{"term":"얼른","audio":"/audio/d658f46882498576d5d6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67315","senseId":"1","lemma":"얼른","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"얼른","audio":"/audio/d658f46882498576d5d6.mp3"}},{"text":"빨지","meaning":"洗","explanation":"빨다：洗；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"빨다","audio":"/audio/6d3502c99e709c97953b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65866","senseId":"1","lemma":"빨다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"빨지","audio":"/audio/28e919e7fbc12c048038.mp3"}},{"text":"않으면","meaning":"不","explanation":"않다：不；으면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"않다","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17186","senseId":"1","lemma":"않다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"않으면","audio":"/audio/d096a85957f74d1fe3b5.mp3"}},{"text":"얼룩이","meaning":"斑渍，污渍，斑迹","explanation":"얼룩：斑渍，污渍，斑迹；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"얼룩","audio":"/audio/bef1d31418ba1aa68d37.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67308","senseId":"2","lemma":"얼룩","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"얼룩이","audio":"/audio/3e40d9cbab455bad5a68.mp3"}},{"text":"남겠어.","meaning":"留下","explanation":"남다：留下；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"남다","audio":"/audio/10946131f919fe8058dd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64552","senseId":"7","lemma":"남다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"남겠어","audio":"/audio/700c5ae879208b03f8a4.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"dbfb08997ec518d3","term":"큰일","zh":"大事","audio":"/audio/dbfb08997ec518d3dc88.mp3","entryId":"72174","definition":"无法挽回的大事故或不好的事情。","pronunciation":["크닐"]},{"id":"d658f46882498576","term":"얼른","zh":"快地","audio":"/audio/d658f46882498576d5d6.mp3","entryId":"67315","definition":"不拖延时间就。","pronunciation":["얼른"]},{"id":"6d3502c99e709c97","term":"빨다","zh":"洗","audio":"/audio/6d3502c99e709c97953b.mp3","entryId":"65866","definition":"将衣服等放在水里，用手揉搓或用洗衣机除去污渍。","pronunciation":["빨다"]},{"id":"b69b8939cafeac28","term":"않다","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3","entryId":"17186","definition":"不做某种行动。","pronunciation":["안타"]},{"id":"bef1d31418ba1aa6","term":"얼룩","zh":"斑渍，污渍，斑迹","audio":"/audio/bef1d31418ba1aa68d37.mp3","entryId":"67308","definition":"沾到液体等或液体等滲入后产生的痕迹。","pronunciation":["얼룩"]},{"id":"10946131f919fe80","term":"남다","zh":"留下","audio":"/audio/10946131f919fe8058dd.mp3","entryId":"64552","definition":"作为某种状况的结果而出现某种状态。","pronunciation":["남ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/7c32c81e530638ec07b2.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.76,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=67308","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"중급","day":88,"sequenceScore":2.4134,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["糟了，不赶紧洗的话会留下污渍的。","你的衣服上洒了果汁哦。","明天要去看棒球比赛吧？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你的衣服上洒了果汁哦。","明天要去看棒球比赛吧？","糟了，不赶紧洗的话会留下污渍的。"],"answer":2}]}
